<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>MOHALI, India 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the first</p>
<p>match in the best-of-three final of the Independence Cup cricket</p>
<p>tournament between Sri Lanka and Pakistan on Saturday:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka</p>
<p> S.Jayasuriya c sub (M.Wasim) b Hussain	96</p>
<p> M.Atapattu lbw b Hussain			  53</p>
<p> A.De Silva st Khan b Saqlain		    90</p>
<p> A.Ranatunga st Khan b Saqlain		   80</p>
<p> R.Kaluwitharana not out			    1</p>
<p> D.Liyanage not out				   1</p>
<p> Extras (lb-8 nb-2  w-8)			   18</p>
<p> Total (for four wickets in 50 overs)	 339</p>
<p>Did not bat: R.Mahanama, H.Tillekeratne,K.Dharmasena, S.De</p>
<p>Silva, M.Muralitharan.</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-148 2-184 3-337 4-338.</p>
<p>Bowling: Razzak 5-0-41-0 (2w,2nb) Javed 9-0-64-0, Afridi</p>
<p>10-0-63-0, Saqlain 10-0-72-2(1w), Hussain 10-0-56-2, Malik</p>
<p>6-0-35-0(5w).</p>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p> S.Anwar c Liyanage b S.De Silva		14</p>
<p> S.Afridi c Atapattu b S.De Silva	     18</p>
<p> M.Hussain b S.De Silva			    8</p>
<p> R.Raja run out				     42</p>
