<p> A.Javed lbw b Dharmasena			  5</p>
<p> Inzamam-ul-Haq absent injured</p>
<p> A.Razzak absent injured</p>
<p> Extras (lb-1 nb-1 w-8)			   10</p>
<p> Total (for eight wickets in 43.5 overs)   224</p>
